;	V55	Formating of al 8" SS disks working
;	V56	Combined all sec R/W tests into one core routine
;	V58	Working on side selection, fixed some formatting issues including CPM86 disks
;	V59	Fixed side_sel to actully select the proper side (Note debug display present)
