Sorry that is an invalid drive␀
Is this a 5" or 8" Drive (5,8): ␀

Possible 8" disk formats:-
A = 128 Bytes/Sec, 26 Sec/Ttk. 8" SDSS. (IBM 3740 Format)
B = 128 Bytes/Sec, 50 Sec/Ttk. 8" DDSS. (SD Systems 8" DD Format)
C = 256 Bytes/Sec, 26 Sec/Ttk. 8" DDDS. (IBM System 34 Format)
D = 512 Bytes/Sec, 15 Sec/Trk. 8" DDDS. 
E = 1024 Bytes/Sec, 9 Sec/Trk. 8" DDSS. (For CPM3 System)
F = 1024 Bytes/Sec, 9 Sec/Trk. 8" DDDS.
Please select a disk format: ␀

Possible 5" disk formats:-
A = 512 Bytes/Sec, 8 Sec/Ttk. 5" DDDS. (CPM3 & IBM PC CPM-86 Format)
B = 128 Bytes/Sec, 18 Sec/Ttk. 5" SDSS. (SD Systems 5" SD Format)
C = 128 Bytes/Sec, 29 Sec/Ttk. 5" DDSS. (SD Systems 5" DD Format)
D = 512 Bytes/Sec, 9 Sec/Ttk. 5" DDDS. (DEC VT180 Format)
E = 256 Bytes/Sec, 16 Sec/Ttk. 5" DDDS. (TOSHIBA T-100 Format)
F = 128 Bytes/Sec, 18 Sec/Ttk. 5" SDDS. (CROMEMCO-SD CDOS Format)
G = 512 Bytes/Sec, 10 Sec/Ttk. 5" DDDS. (CROMEMCO-DD CDOS Format)
