   103                  ;
   104                  ;The Index register IX is used throughout the program t
   105                  ;table of the currently selected drive/disk format
   106                  ;[IX+HW_BYTE] will point to (DRIVE) and will contain th
   107                  ;hardware selection bits. Drive sel 0,1,2,3 and side A 
   108                  ;other flags (see below) 
   109                  ;Remember the bits for disk selection and side selectio
